A||||6||magnum||Will a 3.4 work?||||1||
Z||000000||magnum||03-31-2001||03:59 PM||||Hi, I have an 85Gt and I was told a pontiac 3.4 single cam would fit. If so, how much of a hassle to put in. I'm having a local mechanic do it. Any info is appreciated. Thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||c m west||03-31-2001||04:22 PM||||It is as simple as putting in another 2.8, just retain the 3.4 injectors and drill into the block for the starter motor<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||magnum||03-31-2001||04:41 PM||||Thanks. I more thing. I sthere anything that I can do to add a llittle HP that won't cost too much before it is put in? Also, Does the 3800 go in just as easy? Thanks!||||reg||1
Z||000003||Seanh||03-31-2001||05:11 PM||||3800 is alot more involved then the 3.4. You use only the 3.4 block, and use the heads and intake up, off the 2.8 engine. You could get a set of new SS valves, have your heads decked, ported maybe. Get your TB bored out and manifolds ported while off the engine.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Seanh||03-31-2001||05:13 PM||||Also, send you injectors to <A HREF="http://www.injector.com" TARGET=_blank>www.injector.com</A>   I did this to my engine, and I am very happy with the results. It doesn't really "add" any HP, more like it restores lost HP. I thought it was well worth it to have them rebuilt and I feel a noticable difference.||||reg||1
Z||000005||skitime||03-31-2001||05:31 PM||||Simple and cheap horsepower is to port the manifolds. Suppose to  gain 10 horsepower.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Carrolles||04-02-2001||08:45 AM||||I believe the Camaro heads and the Fiero heads are the same.  You'll need to transplant the Fiero intake manifolds and water pump to the 3.4 engine and install the distributor and move the starter to the other side.  You may also need a new flywheel.  Check Ed Park's Fierofactory web site for a writeup.<P>Also take a look through <BR>  <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/biz/fierosails/info.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/biz/fierosails/info.html</A> <P>Good luck,<P>Carroll||||reg||1
